Title:                  LZMA SDK
Description:            LZMA Software Development Kit
Summary:                The LZMA SDK provides the documentation, samples, header files, libraries, and tools you need to develop applications that use LZMA compression. LZMA / LZMA2 are default and general compression methods of 7z format in the 7-Zip program.
Keywords:               c, assembly, programming, library, 7z, 7zip
